<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Soporcel posts results Feb 25.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Soporcel posts results Feb 25.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paste and paper group Soporcel-Sociedade Portuguesa de Celulose said it will present its 1996 results on February 25.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035.</p>
</text>
